/*
 * folding.gray:  Number literals folded at full width. An integer is a sign and
 * a 320-bit magnitude, wide enough for every integer type plus intermediate
 * results.
 *
 * Author:  Marshall A Burns <marshallbcodes@gmail.com>
 * GitHub: @SchoolyB
